6le17ob04re2img01.jpg", "audiosrc": "engenn6le17ob04re2aud01", "images": [{"time": "0", "image": "engenn6le17ob04re2img01.jpg", "id": 0, "text": ""}, {"time": "100", "image": "engenn6le17ob04re2img01.jpg", "id": 1, "text": "Strike a pose!</br>One of the fastest growing sports in the world isn't something people would expect. In fact, most people don't realize that it's a sport at all. It's ballroom dancing! All over the globe, great numbers of people are doing the waltz, tango, and rumba in classes, exhibitions, and competitions."}, {"time": "20000", "image": "engenn6le17ob04re2img01.jpg", "id": 2, "text": "Want to stay healthy and toned?These athletes are some of the fittest and most dynamic in the world. In countries like Japan and Korea, ballroom dancing is popular with older people because it reminds them of the past and it is a great way to maintain one's ability and stop body stiffness.Younger people are trying it too because it's one of the best ways to meet friends. It's also a very romantic thing to do on that all-important \"first date.\""}, {"time": "46000", "image": "engenn6le17ob04re2img01.jpg", "id": 3, "text": "So many people have taken up ballroom dancing that it became an exhibition sport in the 2000 Olympics! Who knows, maybe someday there will be an Olympic Waltzing Champion of the world!"}]}}], "template_override": 1, "title": "", "type": "audio", "id": 1, "_data": []}, {"contents": [{"type": "audio", "value": "engenn6le17ob04re6aud07"}], "template_override": 1, "title": "", "type": "text", "id": 3, "_data": []}], "id": 0, "_data": [{"contents": [{"type": "has_nav", "content": true}, {"type": "has_exercise_controls", "content": true}], "type": "lab_options"}]}], "_data": [{"contents": [{"type": "lesson_name", "content": "Leisure Time"}, {"type": "unit_name", "content": "Ballroom Dancing"}, {"type": "position", "content": 4}, {"type": "origin", "content": "stub"}, {"type": "lesson", "content": 17}, {"type": "level", "content": "B1.1"}], "type": "metadata"}, {"contents": [{"type": "test", "content": "false"}], "type": "achievment_test"}, {"contents": [{"type": "primary", "content": " Describe  routines and regular activities in a wider range of social and work contexts."}, {"type": "secondary_1", "content": " Understands important and some specific information and aspects of attitude and intention using a range of appropriate language, in written or spoken documents or presentations"}, {"type": "secondary_2", "content": " Understands important and some specific information and aspects of attitude and intention using a range of appropriate language, in written or spoken documents or presentations"}, {"type": "secondary_3", "content": " Understands important and some specific information and aspects of attitude and intention using a range of appropriate language, in written or spoken documents or presentations"}, {"type": "secondary_4", "content": " Understands important and some specific information and aspects of attitude and intention using a range of appropriate language, in written or spoken documents or presentations"}, {"type": "secondary_5", "content": " Understands important and some specific information and aspects of attitude and intention using a range of appropriate language, in written or spoken documents or presentations"}, {"type": "secondary_6", "content": " Understands important and some specific information and aspects of attitude and intention using a range of appropriate language, in written or spoken documents or presentations"}, {"type": "secondary_7", "content": " Understands important and some specific information and aspects of attitude and intention using a range of appropriate language, in written or spoken documents or presentations"}, {"type": "secondary_8", "content": " Understands important and some specific information and aspects of attitude and intention using a range of appropriate language, in written or spoken documents or presentations"}], "type": "objectives"}, {"type": "background_image", "content": "engenn6le17ob04re1img01.png"}, {"contents": [{"type": "heading", "content": "St sound combinations"}, {"type": "describer", "content": "Consonant clusters like st can occur at the beginning of a word in English.</br>Practice blending the sound from one consonant sound into the next without adding a vowel sound in between."}, {"type": "text", "content": "Example:"}, {"type": "table", "content": "{\"rows\":2,\"columns\":4,\"cells\":[\"{\\\"type\\\": \\\"text\\\", \\\"content\\\": \\\"storm\\\"}\",\"{\\\"type\\\": \\\"text\\\", \\\"content\\\": \\\"stage\\\"}\",\"{\\\"type\\\": \\\"text\\\", \\\"content\\\": \\\"stun\\\"}\",\"{\\\"type\\\": \\\"text\\\", \\\"content\\\": \\\" stump\\\"}\",\"{\\\"type\\\": \\\"text\\\", \\\"content\\\": \\\" story\\\"}\",\"{\\\"type\\\": \\\"text\\\", \\\"content\\\": \\\"stove\\\"}\",\"{\\\"type\\\": \\\"text\\\", \\\"content\\\": \\\"student\\\"}\",\"{\\\"type\\\": \\\"text\\\", \\\"content\\\": \\\"stub\\\"}\"],\"styles\":\"\"}"}, {"type": "example", "content": "Strike a pose! "}, {"type": "example", "content": "Want to stay healthy and toned?"}], "type": "learning_points"}, {"contents": [{"type": "heading", "content": "Linking and deletion of superlatives"}, {"type": "describer", "content": "You use a superlative adjective to express the highest  of a quality. You use a superlative adjective to talk about one thing or person in a group of things. You always use the with <span class = \"italic\">the </span> superlative."}, {"type": "text", "content": "In natural conversation, it is common to link and delete some sounds in the superlative adjective if there is a similar sound in the next word. "}, {"type": "text", "content": "For example:"}, {"type": "text", "content": "<span class = \"italic\">The strangest story.</br>  You delete the \u2018t' sound and link the \u2018s' sound. </br>The stranges_story. </span>"}, {"type": "text", "content": "Sometimes this makes it hard to listen to native speakers talk. If you know the rule, you can listen better. "}, {"type": "text", "content": "The smallest sweater  =  The smalles_sweater"}, {"type": "text", "content": "The loudest truck = The loudes_truck"}, {"type": "example", "content": "the most dynamic"}, {"type": "example", "content": "the best ways"}], "type": "learning_points"}, {"contents": [{"type": "name", "content": "to strike"}, {"type": "definition", "content": "to move into position"}, {"type": "part_speech", "content": "(verb)"}, {"type": "example", "content": "Example: Strike a pose!"}, {"type": "audio", "content": "engenn6le17ob04aud01"}], "type": "target_word"}, {"contents": [{"type": "text", "content": " These are words you use in paragraph about dancing."}], "type": "target_word_describer"}, {"contents": [{"type": "name", "content": "to pose"}, {"type": "definition", "content": "to stand, sit, or lie down in a particular position"}, {"type": "part_speech", "content": "(verb)"}, {"type": "example", "content": "Example: Are you in the right pose?"}, {"type": "audio", "content": "engenn6le17ob04aud02"}], "type": "target_word"}, {"contents": [{"type": "name", "content": "dynamic"}, {"type": "definition", "content": "always active or changing"}, {"type": "part_speech", "content": "(adjective)"}, {"type": "example", "content": "Example: These athletes are some of the fittest and most dynamic in the world. "}, {"type": "audio", "content": "engenn6le17ob04aud03"}], "type": "target_word"}, {"contents": [{"type": "name", "content": " all-important"}, {"type": "definition", "content": "very important"}, {"type": "part_speech", "content": "(adjective)"}, {"type": "example", "content": "Example: It's also a very romantic thing to do on that all-important \"first date.\""}, {"type": "audio", "content": "engenn6le17ob04aud04"}], "type": "target_word"}, {"contents": [{"type": "name", "content": " to waltz"}, {"type": "definition", "content": "to dance a waltz"}, {"type": "part_speech", "content": "(verb)"}, {"type": "example", "content": "Example:  It's also a very romantic thing to do on that all-important \"first date.\""}, {"type": "audio", "content": "engenn6le17ob04aud05"}], "type": "target_word"}, {"contents": [{"type": "name", "content": "toned"}, {"type": "definition", "content": "having or showing strength or firmness"}, {"type": "part_speech", "content": "(adjective)"}, {"type": "example", "content": "Example: Want to stay healthy and toned?"}, {"type": "audio", "content": "engenn6le17ob04aud06"}], "type": "target_word"}, {"type": "takeaway_extension", "contents": [{"type": "text", "content": "Research four different types of dancing online."}, {"type": "text", "content": "Watch the dancing online."}, {"type": "text", "content": "Compare the dances. Write notes."}, {"type": "text", "content": "Describe the differences between the dances to a partner."}, {"type": "text", "content": "Use adjectives like <span class=\"italic\">slow</span>, <span class=\"italic\">challenging</span> and superlatives like <span class=\"italic\">the fastest</span>, <span class=\"italic\">the best</span>, <span class=\"italic\">the most interesting</span>."}]}, {"type": "takeaway_assessment", "contents": [{"type": "text", "content": "I research different types of dancing."}, {"type": "text", "content": "I compare dances and write notes."}, {"type": "text", "content": "I describe the differences to a partner."}]}]}